    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Summary : Far away on a snow-covered island, there is a small village inside a forest where a group of animals lived. There&apos;s Pororo, the inquistive and playful penguin; Crong, and the naughty little dinosaur; the good-natured polar bear, Poby; the proud and nosy red fox, Eddy; and the gentle beaver, Loopy. They frequently run into trouble with one another, but quickly learn from their mistakes and remain best of friends. In times of joy or need, they are always there for one another.</marc:subfield>
